WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:05.930
House of the Dragon, the Game of Thrones prequel
series that airs in 2022 on HBO, has been

00:00:05.930 --> 00:00:10.400
filming for months now and you can expect
to see the live-action trailer with most of

00:00:10.400 --> 00:00:12.260
the characters very soon.

00:00:12.260 --> 00:00:16.860
In fact, a very limited amount of people that
mostly includes the press have already seen

00:00:16.860 --> 00:00:18.300
it and they all liked it.

00:00:18.300 --> 00:00:20.910
All of you will see it soon as well, I promise.

00:00:20.910 --> 00:00:24.580
But before that, let me introduce you to the
main characters of the show.

00:00:24.580 --> 00:00:28.680
As most of you already know, House of the
Dragon, is based on George R.R. Martin’s

00:00:28.680 --> 00:00:33.399
Targaryen history book, Fire And Blood, that
begins its tale with the legendary Aegon the

00:00:33.399 --> 00:00:38.010
Conqueror, creator of the Iron Throne, and
goes all the way up to the Targaryen civil

00:00:38.010 --> 00:00:42.410
war that nearly destroyed House Targaryen,
the Dance of the Dragons.

00:00:42.410 --> 00:00:48.079
The Fire And Blood part 2 will continue from
where part 1 ended, with Rhaenyra Targaryen's

00:00:48.079 --> 00:00:53.730
son Aegon lll's reign and will cover Blackyre
rebellions, war with Dorne and go all the

00:00:53.730 --> 00:00:58.460
way to the Mad King and Robert's Rebellion
that ended Targaryen dynasty.

00:00:58.460 --> 00:01:02.710
This particular show, House of the Dragon,
will cover the Dance of the Dragons.

00:01:02.710 --> 00:01:07.970
If you are more interested in other time periods,
do not worry because HBO is working on a total

00:01:07.970 --> 00:01:10.360
of 6 Game of Thrones prequel shows.

00:01:10.360 --> 00:01:13.860
Anyways, back to our main characters of the
House of the Dragon.

00:01:13.860 --> 00:01:18.690
Since the key event of the show is the Dance
of the Dragons - the Targaryen civil war,

00:01:18.690 --> 00:01:23.280
which is also the key event in the history
of House Targaryen, as you might have guessed

00:01:23.280 --> 00:01:26.320
it, Targaryens are mostly the main characters.

00:01:26.320 --> 00:01:31.410
Season 1 of House of the Dragon will see a
build-up towards the Dance of the Dragons.

00:01:31.410 --> 00:01:36.930
The show will not jump straight into the Targaryen
civil war, it will start with a prelude, with

00:01:36.930 --> 00:01:42.350
King Viserys l sitting on the Iron Throne,
and with a huge rivalry between his children.

00:01:42.350 --> 00:01:48.470
On one side we have King Viserys' daughter
and chosen heir, Rhaenyra, supported by her

00:01:48.470 --> 00:01:55.420
father's cousin, Rhaenys Targaryen slash Velaryon,
her uncle Daemon Targaryen and Corlys Velaryon,

00:01:55.420 --> 00:01:57.930
the Sea Snake, among many more.

00:01:57.930 --> 00:02:02.890
On the other hand we have Rhaenyra's younger
half-sibling Aegon Targaryen supported by

00:02:02.890 --> 00:02:09.259
his mother, Queen Alicent Hightower, his grandfather,
Otto Hightower who is the Hand of the King

00:02:09.259 --> 00:02:13.159
and Ser Criston Cole, who is the Lord Commander
of the Kingsguard.

00:02:13.159 --> 00:02:17.129
All the names I just mentioned will be the
main characters in season 1 of the House of

00:02:17.129 --> 00:02:18.409
the Dragon.

00:02:18.409 --> 00:02:23.010
In the first few episodes,the animosity at
the court between Rhaenyra's supporters and

00:02:23.010 --> 00:02:26.030
Aegon's supporters will also be established.

00:02:26.030 --> 00:02:30.430
King Viserys I Targaryen is the one who sits
on the Iron Throne at the beginning of the

00:02:30.430 --> 00:02:34.989
series, he is the fifth Targaryen king to
sit on the Iron Throne.

00:02:34.989 --> 00:02:41.010
Viserys is a dragon rider who rode the legendary
Balerion the Black Dread, until the dragon

00:02:41.010 --> 00:02:42.519
died of old age.

00:02:42.519 --> 00:02:48.580
Viserys has a brother, Daemon Targaryen, the
most controversial man of his lifetime, who

00:02:48.580 --> 00:02:53.109
at this point of the series is the King of
the Stepstones and the Narrow Sea.

00:02:53.109 --> 00:02:58.120
Wielding Valyrian steel blade Dark Sister,
Daemon is considered by many to be the most

00:02:58.120 --> 00:02:59.299
dangerous man in Westeros.

00:02:59.299 --> 00:03:04.670
He's the best fighter, he is the best general
and commander and he will prove everyone right

00:03:04.670 --> 00:03:06.469
in the upcoming war.

00:03:06.469 --> 00:03:08.150
But back to King Viserys.

00:03:08.150 --> 00:03:13.540
Viserys had three children by his first queen,
Aemma Arryn, but only one, Princess Rhaenyra,

00:03:13.540 --> 00:03:15.139
survived to adulthood.

00:03:15.139 --> 00:03:21.670
Lacking a son to succeed him, Viserys began
to train Rhaenyra to be his heir, named her

00:03:21.670 --> 00:03:27.489
his heir and Rhaenyra soon acquired the support
of hundreds of lords and landed knights.

00:03:27.489 --> 00:03:34.099
The king remarried in 106 AC, this time to
Alicent Hightower, and had four more children:

00:03:34.099 --> 00:03:37.670
Aegon, Helaena, Aemond, and Daeron.

00:03:37.670 --> 00:03:43.529
In 111 AC, a great tourney was held at King's
Landing on the fifth anniversary of Viserys's

00:03:43.529 --> 00:03:45.669
marriage to Alicent.

00:03:45.669 --> 00:03:50.909
During the opening feast, Queen Alicent wore
a green gown, while Princess Rhaenyra dressed

00:03:50.909 --> 00:03:53.519
in red and black of House Targaryen.

00:03:53.519 --> 00:03:59.260
Note was taken, and soon all of Rhaenyra's
supporters started wearing black clothing,

00:03:59.260 --> 00:04:02.579
while all of Alicent's followers started wearing
green.

00:04:02.579 --> 00:04:07.639
Over time, the popular names applied to both
factions were inspired by the colors they

00:04:07.639 --> 00:04:13.529
wore: Rhaenyra's supporters were called "the
Blacks", and Aegon II's supporters were called

00:04:13.529 --> 00:04:14.829
"the Greens".

00:04:14.829 --> 00:04:21.300
Viserys I strengthened Rhaenyra's place in
the succession by marrying her in 114 AC to

00:04:21.300 --> 00:04:26.810
the son of the Sea Snake, Ser Laenor Velaryon
- who himself had Targaryen blood through

00:04:26.810 --> 00:04:29.780
his mother, Princess Rhaenys.

00:04:29.780 --> 00:04:36.010
Rhaenyra gave birth to three sons—Jacaerys,
Lucerys, and Joffrey Velaryon—during her

00:04:36.010 --> 00:04:41.360
marriage, although there were rumors that
the father of those princes was not Laenor,

00:04:41.360 --> 00:04:43.440
but Ser Harwin Strong.

00:04:43.440 --> 00:04:48.090
One way or the other, House Velaryon plays
a huge role since the very beginning of the

00:04:48.090 --> 00:04:52.020
show and will play a huge role up until the
end.

00:04:52.020 --> 00:04:56.550
The most famous and strongest Velaryion to
ever live is also one of the main characters

00:04:56.550 --> 00:05:01.900
in the upcoming House of the Dragon show – Corlys
Velaryon, known as the Sea Snake.

00:05:01.900 --> 00:05:08.889
He's a fabled Lord of the Tides during Targaryen
civil war, Master of Driftmark, and the head

00:05:08.889 --> 00:05:14.120
of House Velaryon that’s been a loyal ally
to the Targaryens since Aegon the Conqueror.

00:05:14.120 --> 00:05:18.920
During the Conquest, it was Velaryon ships
that carried Aegon’s soldiers across Blackwater

00:05:18.920 --> 00:05:23.280
Bay, and later formed the greater part of
the royal fleet.

00:05:23.280 --> 00:05:28.080
Going even further back into history, House
Velaryon, much like House Targaryen, is from

00:05:28.080 --> 00:05:29.080
Valyria.

00:05:29.080 --> 00:05:36.229
He is the husband of another main character,
Princess Rhaenys Targaryen, the Queen-Who-Never-Was.

00:05:36.229 --> 00:05:41.639
During the Dance of the Dragons, he even becomes
the Hand to Queen Rhaenyra Targaryen who is

00:05:41.639 --> 00:05:44.220
his niece and daughter-in-law.

00:05:44.220 --> 00:05:50.690
After Laenor was executed in Spicetown in
120 AC, Rhaenyra married the other main character,

00:05:50.690 --> 00:05:57.500
her uncle, infamous Rogue Prince, Prince Daemon
Targaryen, younger brother to Viserys I.

00:05:57.500 --> 00:06:04.340
Her sons by him are Aegon the Younger—called
so to distinguish him from his uncle, Alicent's

00:06:04.340 --> 00:06:09.270
Aegon, who on occasion is called Aegon the
Elder—and Viserys.

00:06:09.270 --> 00:06:15.389
The relationship between Rhaenyra and Alicent
declined early in Alicent's marriage to Viserys,

00:06:15.389 --> 00:06:20.220
since both ladies had been trying to be the
realm's first lady, and there could only be

00:06:20.220 --> 00:06:21.340
one.

00:06:21.340 --> 00:06:26.980
Alicent's father, Ser Otto Hightower, had
also disliked Rhaenyra's second husband, Prince

00:06:26.980 --> 00:06:30.819
Daemon, since the beginning of Viserys's reign.

00:06:30.819 --> 00:06:35.759
So up until this point of season 1, we will
learn much and more about these characters,

00:06:35.759 --> 00:06:40.930
their intentions and their loyalties.The war
begins towards the end of season 1 when our

00:06:40.930 --> 00:06:45.840
first main character, King Viserys dies and
his children, the other two main characters,

00:06:45.840 --> 00:06:51.409
Rhaenyra and Aegon, each proclaim themselves
the rightful heir to the throne, and the other

00:06:51.409 --> 00:06:55.150
six main characters rally between one or the
other.

00:06:55.150 --> 00:07:01.000
For Rhaenyra it's her husband Daemon Targaryen,
her own blood Rhaenys and her husband Corlys

00:07:01.000 --> 00:07:02.590
the Sea Snake Velaryon.

00:07:02.590 --> 00:07:08.789
Again, there's many more who support Rhaenyra,
namely House Arryn and House Stark represented

00:07:08.789 --> 00:07:15.070
by the legendary Cregan Stark, but at this
point of the show, they are not yet main characters.

00:07:15.070 --> 00:07:21.050
For Aegon it's his mother Alicent, grandfather
Otto and Ser Criston Cole, although there

00:07:21.050 --> 00:07:26.130
are many more supporting him as well, namely
House Lannister who has their own man at King's

00:07:26.130 --> 00:07:32.009
Landing court, Tyland Lannister, but they
are not the main characters.

00:07:32.009 --> 00:07:37.870
This is when the war begins, but not war of
fire and blood, but war of ravens for now.

00:07:37.870 --> 00:07:42.759
Let me also tell you that at this point of
the story, twenty dragons are alive, but the

00:07:42.759 --> 00:07:46.460
majority will not be by the time this story
is over.

00:07:46.460 --> 00:07:53.099
So as I said, Targaryen civil war begins towards
the end of season 1 when King Viserys dies.

00:07:53.099 --> 00:07:59.310
His designated heir for many years had been
his only surviving child by his first wife,

00:07:59.310 --> 00:08:01.190
his daughter Rhaenyra.

00:08:01.190 --> 00:08:06.300
Since Viserys later remarried, however, and
had several younger children by his second

00:08:06.300 --> 00:08:11.680
wife, Alicent Hightower, the eldest of which
is Aegon, half of the lords of the Seven Kingdoms

00:08:11.680 --> 00:08:18.800
side with King's chosen heir and King's eldest
child, Rhaenyra, while the other half of Westeros

00:08:18.800 --> 00:08:22.690
sides with King's eldest male son, Aegon.

00:08:22.690 --> 00:08:27.789
The Seven Kingdoms had never had a Ruling
Queen before, and many were troubled by the

00:08:27.789 --> 00:08:30.849
thought of Rhaenyra succeeding to the throne.

00:08:30.849 --> 00:08:37.219
By the inheritance laws of the Andals, a younger
brother succeeds ahead of an elder daughter,

00:08:37.219 --> 00:08:43.010
but the Targaryens had never formalized royal
inheritance laws for their new realm after

00:08:43.010 --> 00:08:46.339
the War of Conquest 130 years before.

00:08:46.339 --> 00:08:52.700
Viserys I, however, had extracted oaths of
fealty from the major lords of the realm that

00:08:52.700 --> 00:08:54.350
Rhaenyra would succeed him.

00:08:54.350 --> 00:09:00.760
Anyways, as soon as King Viserys dies, Queen
Alicent Hightower conceals Viserys's death

00:09:00.760 --> 00:09:06.430
from the public and instead has Ser Criston
Cole, the Lord Commander of the Kingsguard,

00:09:06.430 --> 00:09:11.110
summon the small council to Alicent's apartments
in Maegor's Holdfast.

00:09:11.110 --> 00:09:16.649
Criston who once served Rhaenyra, convinced
Viserys's son, Prince Aegon the Elder, to

00:09:16.649 --> 00:09:20.470
claim the rule of the Seven Kingdoms as his
father lay dead.

00:09:20.470 --> 00:09:23.550
For this he became known as Criston the Kingmaker.

00:09:23.550 --> 00:09:29.840
Viserys had decreed his heir to be Rhaenyra
Targaryen, Princess of Dragonstone, the daughter

00:09:29.840 --> 00:09:33.300
from his first wife, Aemma Arryn.

00:09:33.300 --> 00:09:39.510
The greens at the Red Keep support Aegon the
Elder, the eldest son of his second wife Alicent,

00:09:39.510 --> 00:09:44.970
however, and Criston takes into custody any
blacks remaining at court.

00:09:44.970 --> 00:09:48.769
Alicent forbids septons and silent sisters
from treating Viserys's body.

00:09:48.769 --> 00:09:55.230
A week after Viserys's death, his passing
is finally publicly revealed with the greens

00:09:55.230 --> 00:09:59.100
accounting the accession of Aegon II Targaryen.

00:09:59.100 --> 00:10:03.650
The silent sisters then prepared the late
king's body for the traditional burning of

00:10:03.650 --> 00:10:04.660
a Targaryen.

00:10:04.660 --> 00:10:10.460
At Dragonstone, Rhaenyrafinds out that her
father died and Aegon staged a coup and was

00:10:10.460 --> 00:10:12.750
crowned King in King’s Landing.

00:10:12.750 --> 00:10:19.120
She refuses to recognize the claim of Aegon,
her younger half-brother, and the blacks instead

00:10:19.120 --> 00:10:21.029
support her as queen.

00:10:21.029 --> 00:10:26.780
Rhaenyra, as Princess of Dragonstone, has
her powerbase on Dragonstone island, where

00:10:26.780 --> 00:10:32.720
she responds by being crowned queen by Daemon
and declaring Aegon a traitor.

00:10:32.720 --> 00:10:37.800
The rival claims to Viserys's inheritance
leads to the Dance of the Dragons, the civil

00:10:37.800 --> 00:10:42.740
war between the blacks and the greens, the
very war in which most of the characters will

00:10:42.740 --> 00:10:44.730
die along with their dragons.

00:10:44.730 --> 00:10:46.839
Who’s claim do you support?

00:10:46.839 --> 00:10:48.360
Aegon’s or Rhaenyra’s?

00:10:48.360 --> 00:10:52.390
Who is your favorite character and which dragon
are you looking forward to see the most?

00:10:52.390 --> 00:10:53.620
Thank you so much for watching.

00:10:53.620 --> 00:10:57.250
If you enjoyed this video please give it a
big thumbs up and I hope to see you in the

00:10:57.250 --> 00:11:00.490
next one.

00:11:00.490 --> 00:11:03.350
Peace!

